{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartsymbol\/color"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol\/color","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLPartSymbolV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp","role":"symbol","title":"color","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor","title":"MXLColor","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartSymbol":{"title":"MXLPartSymbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The part-symbol type indicates how a symbol for a multi-staff part is indicated in the score; brace is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default value. The top-staff and bottom-staff attributes are used when the brace does not extend across the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entire part. For example, in a 3-staff organ part, the top-staff will typically be 1 for the right hand, while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the bottom-staff will typically be 2 for the left hand. Staff 3 for the pedals is usually outside the brace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"By default, the presence of a part-symbol element that does not extend across the entire part also indicates a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponding change in the common barlines within a part."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartsymbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartSymbol"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartSymbol"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartSymbol/color":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"color","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol\/color","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartsymbol\/color"}}}